{
  "note": "Live history-ledger vectors (capsule-engine #137 live-check-history-ledger, #136 proposal_at/history item_ref); each file byte for byte from its source, except that engine-0ab20965/MIRROR.md and seal-disposition-213/README.md had internal work-item references reworded for publication; this sidecar is not part of those bytes.",
  "sources": {
    "engine-0ab20965/": "the engine side's go-vectors for the live-check history ledger, at capsule-engine 0ab2096597187dc805949e7df722b93af22991fc (merge of #137): README.md, MIRROR.md, check-inputs/ and expected_live.json. expected_live.json equals tests/fixtures/live-history/expected_live.json at 0ab20965 (git show), which that commit's test_the_decisions_are_expected_live_json regenerates byte for byte (rerun in a scratch clone); decided under asg/seller/0.1.2.",
    "engine-08cd96d/": "tests/fixtures/live-history/{expected_live.json,README.md,buyer-a.bundle.json,buyer-b.bundle.json} at capsule-engine 08cd96d03b6b23e0a7b71169dd5c24ea0381ff04 (after #138 and #139), regenerated byte for byte by that commit's own test; decided under asg/seller/0.1.3, with the claims-in-history variant. Its check inputs are byte-identical to engine-0ab20965/check-inputs (cmp), so they are not vendored twice.",
    "engine-b455063a/": "capsule-engine b455063a26b8263bbedb80fc2bc837aff2732e69 (merge of #144; after #140-#143): live-history/{expected_live.json,README.md} = tests/fixtures/live-history/ (asg/seller/0.1.3, capsulectl 424e794); history-act-counterparty/{expected_live.json,README.md} and inputs/<set>/*.input.json = tests/fixtures/history-act-counterparty/ (#141, asg/everyday/0.3.6); live-history-untyped-acts/ = tests/fixtures/live-history-untyped-acts/ (#144, capsulectl rc14 and 2214b0f bytes, asg/everyday/0.3.6). Each expected_live.json is byte-identical to the engine side's second-round live-check history-ledger go-vectors (MANIFEST.sha256 verified) and was regenerated byte for byte by that commit's own tests in a scratch clone (117 passed). given/ holds, for each way, the envelope the engine's own test function returns (tests/test_live_history.py _given and tests/test_history_act_counterparty.py _given at b455063a), written as sorted compact JSON: what the engine decided. Except history-act-counterparty/expected_live.json, which is at capsule-engine 14ca6ea7f5339fe0e3e019cf99f1640798d6b0dc (merge of #145; = hotel-two-deal/expected_live.json in the engine side's history-act counterparty-target go-vectors, MANIFEST.sha256 verified): #145 changed only that file and the fixture's _decide (task_authority_record passed), moving exactly the ten typed r26 rows n/a -> pass. Its README, inputs and given/ are unchanged at 14ca6ea7 (cmp). tests/fixtures/live-history/expected_live.json is unchanged at 14ca6ea7 and c49a9258 (f3651324…); the go-vectors live-history/expected_live.json (cbebbec1…) is the pre-#139 build at aa47cf90, not vendored.",
    "seal-disposition-213/": "the vectors staged for capsule-cli #213: every file byte for byte, verified by its own SHA256SUMS (sha256 3eb6be91edd09e1e759294b04c65c135334bd1404f2c7b9931e3086809fbcd9d); README.md there is ours. Producer capsulectl c7ff0880a353159a8c022de03a116452f1bd5e61 (v0.1.0-rc15-10-gc7ff088), merged as c3d464f7ac7cda26765d4ed8b5ebe719929b5bf1 (a comment differs, no code); decisions by capsule-engine fd43d43 (asg/seller/0.1.3 and asg/everyday/0.3.6)."
  },
